Project Title
Pocket Smart AI – Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

## Main Modules

1. User Input Module
2. Income Management Module
3. Expense Management Module
4. Budget Management Module
5. Expense Analysis Module
6. AI Recommendation Module
7. Report and Result Module

## System Flow

User Input
     ↓
Income & Expense Data
     ↓
Data Processing
     ↓
Budget Calculation
     ↓
Expense Analysis
     ↓
AI Recommendation
     ↓
Final Result

## Design Objective
The system is designed to provide a simple and user-friendly method for managing personal budgets and understanding spending patterns.
